#: src/admin/App.js:239
msgid "Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page."
msgstr "ቤታ ስሪቶች ከሂሳባቸው ጋር ለተያያዙ ፈቃድ ያላቸው የPro ጭነቶች ይሰጣሉ። አንዴ ከተገናኙ በኋላ, ከሂሳብ ገጽ መቀላቀል ይችላሉ።"

#: src/admin/App.js:255
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "ቅንብሮችን አስቀምጥ"

#: src/editor/index.js:17
msgid "Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here."
msgstr "ሁለተኛ ቋንቋ በአስተዳዳሪው ምናሌ ውስጥ ካለው ትራንዝሊ (Tranzly) ስር ያክሉ፣ እና መቀየሪያው እዚህ ይታያል።"

#: src/editor/index.js:29
msgid "Switcher"
msgstr "መቀያየሪያ"

#: src/editor/index.js:32
msgid "Accessible label"
msgstr "የሚደረስበት መለያ"

#: blocks/fixture-switcher/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Language switcher"
msgstr "የቋንቋ መቀየሪያ"

#: blocks/fixture-switcher/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Links to this page in each of the site's languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed."
msgstr "የጣቢያው እያንዳንዱ ቋንቋ በዚህ ገጽ ላይ የሚያደርጋቸው አገናኞች። ሁለት ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ቋንቋዎች እስኪዘረዘሩ ድረስ ምንም ነገር አያሳይም።"

#: blocks/fixture-switcher/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "language"
msgstr "ቋንቋ"

#: blocks/fixture-switcher/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "switcher"
msgstr "መቀየሪያ"

#: blocks/fixture-switcher/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "translation"
msgstr "ትርጉም"
